Z||000004||Oreif||12-03-2000||11:02 PM||||That particular kit on Ebay is for bottom mounted speakers. It won't work on top mounted speakers unless you want to pull the entire dash out to install them. Also fitting a 6X9 speaker on the drivers side is very tight. Adding another inch is probably impossible.||||reg||1
Z||000005||sqoach||12-03-2000||11:32 PM||||bam, i'm not completely sure on the din sizes and stuff. i do know that fieros have a din and 1/2 size opening. the regular din size is what you'll see most for in-car cd players.  if you got a din size, you need a kit or something to get it to fit in the fiero opening.<BR>hope that helped  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sQoaCh<BR>fiero7@hotmail.com<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
